   "reason": "[\"No held source gives an exact first-end date, actor and mechanism for the section 15 text that EO 8215 substituted into EO 1888. The only held statements are editorial: the 1989 OFR Codification text for EO 1888 says \\\"Secs. 1-19 are obsolete and superseded. See Canal Zone Code of 1963, ch. 7, 76A Stat.\\\" with no date and no instrument naming section 15 or EO 8215, and a statute that does not name the target does not end it (owner ruling 2026-10-21 on unnamed instruments). EO 9212 (1942) overrides section 15 \\\"Notwithstanding\\\" for a war-period term and does not revoke it. Missing source: the text of the Canal Zone Code of 1963 chapter 7 (76A Stat. 1) with its enacting act and effective date, or a later order or statute that names EO 1888 section 15 or EO 8215, or the Panama Canal Act of 1979 / Canal Zone termination instrument (Oct. 1, 1979) together with a source showing it extinguished this command.\"]"
